  "translation": "Ba monyakeditše ⟨את⟩ pelo ya bona, gomme ona le jo, banna ba toropong, banna — barwa ba go se lega letho — ba dikiletše ⟨את⟩ ntlo, ba kgotletše go lebati, ba bolela go monna, mong wa ntlo, mokgolokwana, a re: Ntšha ⟨את⟩ monna yo a tsenago ntlong ya gago, gore re mo tsebe.",
